---
const whatsappUrl =
  "https://wa.me/5561999195497?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20estive%20no%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20agendar%20uma%20consulta.";
---

<section id="sobre" class="doctor" aria-labelledby="doctor-title">
  <div class="doctor-panel">
    <header class="doctor-strip" data-reveal>
      <p class="doctor-pill"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> CONHEÇA A DRA. RAFFAELA</p>
      <img src="/clones/raffaeladrumond-com-br/images/Group-1707479095.png" alt="Dra. Raffaela Drumond, Médica Dermatologista" width="604" height="147" loading="lazy" />
    </header>

    <figure class="doctor-photo" data-reveal>
      <img src="/clones/raffaeladrumond-com-br/images/Group-1707479095-1.webp" alt="Retratos da Dra. Raffaela Drumond" width="715" height="1008" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <article class="doctor-copy" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="doctor-title" class="rd-title">Um pouco<br />sobre a minha<br /><em>história</em></h2>
      <p>Com mais de duas décadas de atuação em dermatologia, a Dra. Raffaela Drumond construiu sua prática baseada em critério médico, diagnóstico preciso e acompanhamento contínuo.<br /><br />Formada em Medicina há 25 anos, com residência em Clínica Médica e Dermatologia, atua em Brasília há mais de 20 anos nas áreas clínica, cirúrgica e estética, sempre com foco em indicações responsáveis e resultados sustentáveis.<br /><br />Cada tratamento é conduzido com base em conhecimento acumulado, leitura individual da pele e respeito à biologia de cada paciente.</p>
      <a class="rd-button" href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span>AGENDAR CONSULTA COM A DRA.</span><span class="button-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .doctor {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    height: 1536px;
    padding: 90px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #444a30 url("/clones/raffaeladrumond-com-br/images/Group-1707479000.png") center top / cover no-repeat;
  }

  .doctor-panel {
    position: relative;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    height: 1356px;
    border-radius: 14px 14px 0 0;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .doctor-strip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    height: 163px;
    padding: 0 69px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--fg-2);
  }

  .doctor-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 250px;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-height: 56px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 35, 15, .18);
    border-radius: 100px;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .doctor-pill span {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 23px;
    line-height: 0;
  }

  .doctor-strip img {
    display: block;
    width: 329px;
    height: 80px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .doctor-pill { transform: translateY(11px); }

    .doctor-strip img { transform: translate(-65px, 11px); }
  }

  .doctor-photo {
    position: absolute;
    top: 293px;
    left: 62px;
    width: 677px;
    height: 954px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .doctor-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 18px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .doctor-copy {
    position: absolute;
    top: 211px;
    left: 769px;
    width: 539px;
  }

  .doctor-copy .rd-title {
    width: 419px;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .doctor-copy .rd-title em {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 15px;
  }

  .doctor-copy p {
    margin: 32px 0 0;
    color: #101010;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .doctor-copy .rd-button {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1011px;
    left: 0;
    width: 498px;
    min-height: 96px;
    padding: 26px 100px 26px 60px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-on);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .button-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    right: 60px;
    display: grid;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1199px) {
    .doctor {
      height: auto;
      padding: 72px 0;
    }

    .doctor-panel {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
      height: auto;
      min-height: 1220px;
      margin-inline: auto;
      padding-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .doctor-strip { padding-inline: 36px; }

    .doctor-photo {
      top: 250px;
      left: 5%;
      width: 48%;
      height: auto;
      aspect-ratio: 677 / 954;
    }

    .doctor-copy {
      top: 230px;
      right: 5%;
      left: auto;
      width: 40%;
    }

    .doctor-copy .rd-title {
      width: auto;
      font-size: clamp(48px, 5.5vw, 64px);
    }

    .doctor-copy .rd-button {
      position: relative;
      top: auto;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 719px) {
    .doctor { padding: 50px 0; }

    .doctor-panel {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 0;
      border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
      padding-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .doctor-strip {
      height: auto;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 26px 22px;
    }

    .doctor-strip img {
      width: min(280px, 100%);
      height: auto;
      align-self: flex-end;
    }

    .doctor-pill {
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .doctor-photo,
    .doctor-copy {
      position: relative;
      top: auto;
      right: auto;
      left: auto;
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
      height: auto;
      margin: 38px auto 0;
    }

    .doctor-photo { aspect-ratio: 677 / 954; }

    .doctor-copy .rd-title {
      width: auto;
      font-size: 43px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .doctor-copy .rd-title br { display: none; }

    .doctor-copy p {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .doctor-copy .rd-button {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 80px;
      padding: 18px 65px 18px 22px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .button-arrow {
      right: 20px;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
